{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"submission\":\"update.json\",\"summary\":\"The shutdown experiment completed on a clean copy (CheckRun c5d127c955b549a8888fe6bab568dbce, exit 0) and its single parsed event settles the open question: the accepted duty never completed. The freeze handshake fired (inside_restore_read, so the leader's main loop was provably inside its own Restore handler), the control Barrier on the undisturbed leader returned no error, the leader accepted the Barrier future in state Leader, Shutdown() moved it to Shutdown, and after the bounded observation the future was still unresponded with queued_in_apply_ch=1 of capacity 64; the release path then returned 'failed to write snapshot: unexpected EOF', confirming the occupied handler was the node's own loop and that it resumed. The declared discriminator asked for a completion that would name the responding producer; none occurred, and source shows none can, so the non-completion is not a short-wait artefact: the logFuture has no ShutdownCh, the loop and runFSM exit on shutdownCh, and runLeader's defer covers only leaderState.inflight futures. I recorded the witnessed fact, answered the gap, and asserted the scoped defect with its conditions, three counterweights (the window needs an occupied loop, needs the documented BatchApplyCh option, and involves a node already shutting down) and its limits (single execution; VerifyLeader shares the shape by source but was not exercised). With time left I also opened the next sourced A2 question on authority transfer: LeadershipTransferToServer forwards a caller-named server without checking that it holds a vote, while the target's TimeoutNow path skips pre-vote and campaigns at term+1, yet electSelf only self-votes for voters and voters reject a vote-less candidate after adopting the higher term - so the requested transfer appears unachievable while it deposes the sitting leader and answers the caller without error. A harness (MakeCluster(4), demote one follower through the public API, then name it as the transfer target and sample whether it ever leads, who does lead, and how the term moves) is queued for clean-copy execution, with no defect asserted on that question yet.\"}"}}
